uto Equip Strongest\n- Buy Armor\n\n[ SHOPS ]\n- Buy any Weapon, Potion, or Merchant item\n- Teleport to merchant\n\n[ BONE WORLD ]\n- Live progression tracker (bone swords owned, next weapon, kill target, next portal)\n- Go To Bone World\n- Auto Farm nearest enemy\n- Auto Progress - farms the exact enemy for your next sword, then walks the portal chain\n- Area / portal teleporter\n\n[ CONFIG ]\n- Save / load your settings\n\n[ QUALITY OF LIFE ]\n- Search across all tabs\n- Draggable, resizable, collapsible sidebar + minimize\n- Full mobile support with auto-fit scaling\n- Key system: free 24h key (unlimited) or lifetime\n\nWorks on PC and mobile executors. Enjoy!","tags":["ftmr","saucehub","Fight The Monster Restored"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GETSAUCEHUB/sauce-hub/main/sauce_hub_loader.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6a4b437b5dd992dde4fb5df6","username":"SAUCEHUB","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/6a4b437b5dd992dde4fb5df6-1783317461394.png","status":"offline","id":"6a4b437b5dd992dde4fb5df6","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"https://jnkie.com/get-key/saucehub","views":311,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/9582873717-1784248488026.png","likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-07-17T00:34:48.049Z","executes":230,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a5978a86a3bf36ee0453e67","editBy":{"_id":"6a4b437b5dd992dde4fb5df6","username":"SAUCEHUB","status":"offline","id":"6a4b437b5dd992dde4fb5df6"},"message":"SAUCEHUB.CC","createdAt":"2026-07-17T00:34:48.051Z"}],"comments":[]},{"slug":"4TH-FIGHT-THE-MONSTERS!-FIXED-Kill-aura-44423","_id":"686e8bf4e1763d2301c2ea48","title":"Kill aura","game":{"_id":"686e8bf4e1763d2301c2ea45","gameId":9582873717,"name":"[PART 2!🎆] Fight The Monsters: Revamped","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-b602148fd08ac261a3f